            "rheoli"
          ]
        }
      },
      "intro": "Welsh puts what matters first, then {{fydd}} (will), {{sy'n}} (that is) or {{welodd}} (saw): {{Y gorllewin fydd yn gweld …}} is \"it's the west that will see …\".",
